## Next Steps

To enable analytics tracking:
1. Deploy this application to Vercel
2. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard (Analytics section)
3. Analytics will automatically track page views and visitor data once deployed

The Analytics component is now properly integrated and will start collecting data after deployment to Vercel.
